    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d143">

                <pb facs="0238" n="158" xml:id="pg158"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A3/1864: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>)<anchor n="47"
                        xml:id="d143-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1936-12-30T14:00:00-05:00">December 30,
                            1936—2 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>166. The Japanese Ambassador notified us on December 29 [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >28</hi>] of the formal invocation by His Government of Article 21 in order
                    to retain 15,598 tons of excess submarines.</p>
                <p>We have replied by note<anchor n="48" xml:id="d143-f2"/> that we will exercise
                    our right to retain a proportionate amount of tonnage in the submarine category
                    and on December 31, 1936, will have 15,230 tons of excess submarines.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d143-f1" n="47" type="source" xml:id="d143-f1-content">
                <p>The same to the Ambassador in the United Kingdom as Department’s telegram No.
                    461.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d143-f2" n="48" xml:id="d143-f2-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
